WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.333
A, quote,

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:02.635
act of piracy on the Black Sea,

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.270
according to the government of Ukraine.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.940
A Russian battleship fired warning shots

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.076
at an empty Turkish cargo ship on Sunday

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.845
and then sent a helicopter full

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.680
of Russian servicemen

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.881
to the Turkish vessel

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:15.849
and questioned

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.218
the Turkish captain for an hour.

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:18.952
Russia claims

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.220
that the ship did not respond

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.622
to an inspection request while on land.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.491
Russian shelling hit the southern

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.959
region of her zone.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.328
Buildings and families torn apart.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:29.629
A mom and dad

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.130
their 12 year

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.498
old boy and a just over

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.399
three week

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.968
old baby girl who lived in this house

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.303
did not survive.

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:37.904
In response,

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:38.705
Ukrainian President

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.572
Volodymyr Zelensky

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.775
has vowed, quote, completely fair

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.743
retaliation against Russia.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:44.611
Meanwhile, the U.S.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.211
just announced

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:45.879
a new

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.081
$200 million round of military

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:49.449
aid for Ukraine, which includes

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.784
more artillery,

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.352
air defense, munitions

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.254
and mine clearing equipment.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.056
That last piece especially vital

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.657
as Ukraine's defense minister declares

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.659
Ukraine is now the most heavily

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.761
mined country in the world.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.363
CNN's Nick Paton Walsh

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:05.432
got exclusive access to a team

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.867
that finds those deadly explosives on

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.701
the front lines.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.572
The fires still smolder, but

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.774
dusk moving to the very front

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.476
of Ukraine's counteroffensive.

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.111
Nic Robertson

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:21.781
to

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:24.417
Moscow.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.985
There was intense bombardment

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:27.253
around this area

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.755
and now the sun is setting.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.590
There's the occasional

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.624
round being fired

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.561
for most of it seems to be

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.097
towards Russian positions.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:37.530
All right.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.632
We're here to learn of a new tactic

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.835
that may help Ukraine overcome

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:43.269
one of the hardest obstacles

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.639
here, minefields

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.310
Shellfire is a constant overhead.

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.112
The drone

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:53.213
unit used daylight

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:56.015
to help direct artillery fire

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.551
You see them coming shortly.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.054
So they're using this to correct

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.457
the next shell that's fired

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:08.561
And now they must keep hidden

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.229
combat

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:10.530
on this.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.701
Russell, to seal the Senate Chinook

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.936
or the artillery

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:19.806
task team in the matter will put you up.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.975
There's still the basic problem

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.777
that it's trench warfare and minefields

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:28.014
and by definition makes the going slow

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.451
But as the sky darkens and

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:32.852
the air cools here,

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:35.522
an advantage has emerged.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:37.056
One of their drones is equipped

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.092
with a thermal camera.

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.593
And they've noticed out

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:42.529
in the wide cratered fields,

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:43.897
about four kilometers away,

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:46.499
where the Russians hide something new.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.067
Some of these

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.336
white dots are Russian landmines.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.173
They retain the heat of the summer sun

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.441
as the earth around them cools.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:57.610
The contrast is greatest at dusk.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.812
Or dawn, experts say.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:02.081
So they seem to glow.

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.450
The unit told us they use special charges

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.152
to blow up the mines.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.588
It's not a precise science,

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:09.689
but a huge help

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.391
in seeing an invisible enemy.

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:13.826
But politically philosophical,

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:17.130
no matter somebody's true, you shouldn't

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.366
the families of those

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.101
three first Oscar

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.504
are stuck in these

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:25.705
minutes of violence

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:27.707
and will get the money automatic

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.808
should they out

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:31.644
encircled by mines.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.012
Don't try to tell them

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:33.980
that counteroffensive

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.417
could be faster than

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:38.651
when I

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.221
learned to dig down a lot

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:43.957
because they didn't

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.060
And so contrasting

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.828
that is the capital structure

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.964
to give us much to talk about.

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:54.667
I don't have to go into that to

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:56.035
you know, it's took

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.637
a lot of extensive opportunities.

00:03:57.637 --> 00:04:00.173
No mistake.

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:02.075
There's little time to reflect, though.

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:04.244
Guys from not come, go, go, go.

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.511
There's a Russian helicopter

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:07.380
is spotted coming right at them.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.716
We take cover for it to pass.

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:10.950
This is the kind of threat

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.218
they endure every day.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:14.654
Well, just one piece of information

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:18.558
concerning the running for cover

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:21.461
and then we leave

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:26.633
hours after we left.

00:04:26.633 --> 00:04:27.166
We're told

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.268
that trench network

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:30.203
came under heavy Russian attack,

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:31.838
which they repelled.

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:33.740
But the grind is constant

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.742
and respite left.

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:38.044
And any advantage, no matter how small,

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.512
urgently welcome

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.250
Jake, it's important to remember

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.451
when you look at that

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.020
use of essentially

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:49.188
relatively low technology

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.323
to try and confront

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:52.058
an extraordinary enemy

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:54.193
there, that volume of landmines

00:04:54.193 --> 00:04:55.361
that we often at times,

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:55.595
I think

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:56.863
imagine the Western equipment

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:58.931
given to the Ukrainian military

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:00.266
generously at times

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:00.767
has sort of

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:01.467
been enough

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:02.769
is kind of answer the question of

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:04.537
do they have the tools they need to do

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:05.071
the job here?

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:05.738
They are still up

00:05:05.738 --> 00:05:07.206
against the Russian military

00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:07.840
that have

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.676
quite a lot of sophisticated equipment

00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:10.710
on their sides.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.245
They certainly feel it there

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:13.746
on those front lines.

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:15.181
And day by day,

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.216
they are doing anything they possibly can

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:19.152
to inch forwards that you saw there

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.286
in those thermal images.

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:21.688
Just how many landmines

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:23.956
there are in one small field?

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.291
That's what they're up against.

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:27.026
That is what is taking the limbs

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:28.728
of their colleagues and friends

00:05:28.728 --> 00:05:29.696
every day.

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:31.064
And that is what they're now using.

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:32.031
Those heat cameras

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:33.633
to try and find a way around

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:34.901
ingenuity every day,

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.969
but still a constant grind Jake.

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:38.471
More great reporting

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:39.372
from Nick Paton Walsh

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:40.406
in the Dnipro, Ukraine.

00:05:40.406 --> 00:05:41.307
Thank you so much.

